      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Get ready for an exciting challenge in the game. Your task is to keep
    the ball in the air by controlling it by tapping on different sides of the screen.
    But be careful! If the ball falls down, flies too high or gets stuck between
    the walls, the game is over.\r\nThere are dangerous spinning saws on your way
    that can reduce your health. You only have 5 hearts - each collision with a saw
    reduces your health. But do not despair! The game also has shield boosters that
    will provide you with temporary protection. With a shield, you can not only ignore
    the saws, but also destroy them upon collision!\r\nCollect the stars that come
    your way - each of them adds one point to your score. Become a master of survival,
    collecting as many points as possible and avoiding all dangers!\r        \nThe
    goal of the game: Survive as long as possible and score the maximum number of
    points, overcoming treacherous obstacles and collecting stars. Are you ready
    for the challenge?                                                             "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a2157e1f9c4c4d38841fbb92558f587, type: 2}
